              "text": "पहुँचना (pahũcnā) is a tadbhava, a word inherited from Sanskrit and reshaped by sound change. It comes from prabhūta, \"much, great\" (CDIAL 8716). Prakrit made a verb of it, \"is strong, reaches\", and Hindi kept \"to reach\"."
